    ["故事背景设定在“灰雾之上”的神秘大陆，世界历经混沌纪、黑暗纪、变纪等纪元纪，由神和9大源质构成力量体系。讲述了主角因转运仪式意外进入源堡，伪装成复苏的伪建立塔，他穿越至克莱恩身上破解廷根惨案。"] = "The story is set on a mysterious continent \"Над Серым Туманом\". The world has gone through eras such as the Chaos Era, the Darkness Era, and the Epoch of Change, with a power system composed of God and 9 great Sefirah. It tells the story of the protagonist who, due to an accident during a Fortune-Turning Ritual., enters Sefirah Castle and disguises himself as the awakened pseudo-Tower. He transmigrates into Клейн to solve the Тинген tragedy.",
